---
layout: layouts/default.liquid
tmpl: page
---
{%- comment %} A page: Indiekit's page post type (/about, /now, /uses). A
   titled, dateless document that is not a post — no h-entry, no date, no
   author card, no webmentions, no prev/next. Every file under content/pages/
   is routed here by content/content.11tydata.js, which also recomputes this
   layout's own front matter (tmpl) because a computed layout never merges it;
   see that file. {% endcomment -%}
<article>
	<h1 class="primary-title primary-title-smalltitle">{{ title }}</h1>
	<div class="content-grid">
		<heading-anchors selector="h2,h3">
			{{ content }}
		</heading-anchors>
	</div>
</article>
